{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — Contact & Tools</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfb; --muted:#6b6b6b; --accent:#6b8e7c; --card:#ffffff; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --max-width:980px; font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #fbfbfb 60%);color:#222}
    header{background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(107,142,124,0.08), rgba(107,142,124,0.02));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;padding:22px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:600}
    .brand .logo{width:44px;height:44px;background:var(--accent);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    .nav-links a.cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:9px 12px}
    main{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:28px auto;padding:28px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .card{background:var(--card);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(23,23,23,0.06);padding:18px;border-radius:14px}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:1.6rem}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* pattern accent */
    .pattern-surface{background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:280px 280px;background-repeat:repeat;}

    form.contact{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.95rem}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem}

    /* Blend builder */
    .builder{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
    .blend-output{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .pill{display:inline-block;background:#f1f8f3;color:var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600}
    .blend-card{border:1px dashed rgba(107,142,124,0.25);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}

    /* modal */
    .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,10,10,0.45);display:none;place-items:center;padding:20px}
    .overlay.show{display:grid}
    .modal{max-width:720px;width:100%;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.98), rgba(250,250,250,0.98));padding:20px;border-radius:12px}
    .timer{font-size:2rem;text-align:center}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-top:12px}

    footer{margin-top:28px;padding:20px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem}

    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.builder{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:14px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="logo">A</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:0.95rem">Contact & Tools</div>
            <div style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--muted)">Reach out or try a guided micro-practice</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
          <a href="blends.html">Custom Blends</a>
          <a href="shop.html">Shop</a>
          <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
          <a href="about.html">About</a>
          <a href="book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a href="contact.html" aria-current="page">Connect</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="card pattern-surface">
          <h1>Let's make an approachable plan</h1>
          <p class="lead">Share a little about what you’re hoping to address and pick a quick practice to try now. Our member options also include monthly blends and short coach-led scent moments that may support clearer days.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
            <button onclick="openModal('guided')">Try a 3-minute session</button>
            <a href="book.html" style="text-decoration:none"><button style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;color:var(--muted)">Schedule a call</button></a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick contact</h3>
          <form class="contact" onsubmit="submitContact(event)">
            <input id="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
            <input id="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" />
            <input id="email" placeholder="Email" required />
            <select id="interest">
              <option value="membership">Membership — recurring support</option>
              <option value="blend">Custom blend</option>
              <option value="session">One-on-one session</option>
              <option value="retail">Product purchase</option>
            </select>
            <textarea id="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us briefly what you hope to get from scent or a membership — we read every message."></textarea>
            <div class="muted">By submitting you consent to being contacted. We do not provide medical advice. If urgent, call local services.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <button type="submit">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" onclick="mailtoContact()" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;color:var(--muted)">Email directly</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Blend builder</h3>
          <p class="muted">Choose a mood and we’ll suggest a simple inhalation or topical blend with a safety-forward dilution guide.</p>
          <div style="height:8px"></div>
          <div class="builder">
            <div>
              <label class="muted">Select a vibe</label>
              <select id="vibeSelect" onchange="buildBlend()">
                <option value="calm">Calm focus</option>
                <option value="energize">Gentle energy</option>
                <option value="rest">Easy sleep support</option>
                <option value="clarity">Clear thinking</option>
                <option value="comfort">Soothing comfort</option>
              </select>

              <div style="margin-top:10px">
                <label class="muted">Use</label>
                <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px">
                  <button onclick="setUse('inhalation')" id="useInh" style="padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6">Inhalation</button>
                  <button onclick="setUse('topical')" id="useTop" style="padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6">Topical (diluted)</button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="margin-top:12px">
                <label class="muted">Bottle size (ml)</label>
                <input type="number" id="bottleSize" value="10" min="2" max="100" onchange="buildBlend()" />
              </div>

              <div style="margin-top:12px">
                <button onclick="buildBlend()">Generate blend</button>
                <button onclick="saveCard()" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;color:var(--muted)">Save card</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="blend-output">
              <div class="pill" id="dilutionPill">Safe guide</div>
              <div class="blend-card" id="blendCard">
                <div class="muted">No blend yet — pick a vibe and generate.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted">The suggestions are non-clinical and may support everyday wellbeing. Always patch test, keep out of reach of pets when using essential oils, and consult a qualified provider for pregnancy or medical questions.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin:0">Need a quick answer?</h4>
          <p class="muted">Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">FAQ — safety first</h3>
      <dl>
        <dt><strong>Are these remedies medical?</strong></dt>
        <dd class="muted">No. Our scent guides and blends are thoughtfully composed and may support mood or relaxation, but they are not medical treatments.</dd>

        <dt><strong>How should I dilute oils for topical use?</strong></dt>
        <dd class="muted">We list dilution ranges on each suggested blend. A common low-risk range for adults is 1-2% for leave-on skin application. For children, pregnant people, or sensitive skin choose lower dilutions and consult a provider. Always perform a patch test.</dd>

        <dt><strong>What about pets?</strong></dt>
        <dd class="muted">Some essential oils can be unsafe for pets. Use caution near animals, avoid applying oils directly to them, and ensure shared spaces have good ventilation.</dd>

        <dt><strong>Pregnancy & nursing</strong></dt>
        <dd class="muted">If pregnant or nursing, consult a qualified healthcare provider before using essential oils.</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
      <div class="muted">Contact • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      <div><a href="pricing.html">Membership & pricing</a> • <a href="about.html">Our approach</a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Modal: Guided micro-practice -->
  <div id="modalOverlay" class="overlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle">
      <h2 id="modalTitle">Brief guided practice</h2>
      <p class="muted">Choose one of three micro-practices and follow the gentle prompts. This is a non-medical calming routine that may support steadier moments.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
        <button onclick="selectPractice('breath')">Breathing</button>
        <button onclick="selectPractice('journaling')">Journaling</button>
        <button onclick="selectPractice('intention')">Intention</button>
      </div>

      <div id="practiceArea" style="margin-top:14px"></div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
        <button onclick="closeModal()" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;color:var(--muted)">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Contact form actions
    function submitContact(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name=document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email=document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const phone=document.getElementById('phone').value.trim();
      const interest=document.getElementById('interest').value;
      const message=document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+name+'\nPhone: '+phone+'\nInterest: '+interest+'\n\nMessage:\n'+message);
      const mail = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+encodeURIComponent('Contact from site: '+name)+'&body='+body;
      window.location.href = mail;
    }
    function mailtoContact(){
      window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}';
    }

    // Blend builder data & logic
    const blendProfiles = {
      calm: {title:'Calm focus', oils:[{name:'Lavender',drops:6},{name:'Sweet orange',drops:3},{name:'Roman chamomile',drops:1}],notes:'Soothing, gentle for inhalation.'},
      energize: {title:'Gentle energy', oils:[{name:'Grapefruit',drops:5},{name:'Peppermint',drops:2},{name:'Bergamot',drops:3}],notes:'Bright, uplifting when inhaled.'},
      rest: {title:'Easy rest', oils:[{name:'Lavender',drops:6},{name:'Cedarwood',drops:3},{name:'Vetiver (small)',drops:1}],notes:'Warm base to help wind down.'},
      clarity: {title:'Clear thinking', oils:[{name:'Rosemary',drops:3},{name:'Lemon',drops:5},{name:'Frankincense',drops:2}],notes:'Focus-supporting aroma blend.'},
      comfort: {title:'Soothing comfort', oils:[{name:'Sweet marjoram',drops:2},{name:'Lavender',drops:5},{name:'Chamomile',drops:3}],notes:'Gentle contouring and calm.'}
    };
    let useMode='inhalation';
    function setUse(mode){useMode=mode;document.getElementById('useInh').style.border='1px solid #e6e6e6';document.getElementById('useTop').style.border='1px solid #e6e6e6';if(mode==='inhalation'){document.getElementById('useInh').style.border='2px solid var(--accent)';}else{document.getElementById('useTop').style.border='2px solid var(--accent)'};buildBlend();}
    function setDefaults(){document.getElementById('useInh').style.border='2px solid var(--accent)';}
    setDefaults();

    function buildBlend(){
      const vibe=document.getElementById('vibeSelect').value;
      const bottle = Math.max(2,Number(document.getElementById('bottleSize').value||10));
      const profile = blendProfiles[vibe];
      const totalDrops = profile.oils.reduce((s,o)=>s+o.drops,0);
      const singleDropVolume=0.05; // mL per drop approx
      const blendVolumeDrops = Math.round((bottle)/singleDropVolume);
      // scale factor
      const scale = Math.max(1, Math.round(blendVolumeDrops/20));
      const lines = [];
      profile.oils.forEach(o=>{
        const d = Math.max(1, Math.round(o.drops*scale));
        lines.push(d+' drops — '+o.name);
      });
      const dilution = computeDilution(useMode,bottle, profile.oils.map(o=>o.drops));
      const pill = document.getElementById('dilutionPill');
      pill.textContent = dilution.title + ' • ' + dilution.note;

      const el = document.getElementById('blendCard');
      el.innerHTML = '';
      const h = document.createElement('div'); h.style.fontWeight='700'; h.textContent=profile.title; el.appendChild(h);
      const ul = document.createElement('div'); ul.style.marginTop='8px'; ul.innerHTML = lines.map(l=>'<div>'+l+'</div>').join(''); el.appendChild(ul);
      const inst = document.createElement('div'); inst.style.marginTop='10px'; inst.innerHTML = '<strong>Instructions</strong><div style="margin-top:6px" class="muted">'+generateInstructions(useMode,bottle,dilution)+'<br/><em style="display:block;margin-top:8px;color:#7a7a7a">Note: always patch test. Keep away from pets. Consult a specialist for pregnancy or medical concerns.</em></div>';
      el.appendChild(inst);
    }

    function computeDilution(use,bottle,oilDrops){
      // Provide human-friendly guidance
      if(use==='inhalation'){
        return {title:'Inhalation (diffuse)',note:'no topical dilution needed'};
      }
      // topical
      // rough dilution percent: total drops in bottle * 0.05 / bottle mL
      const totalDrops = oilDrops.reduce((s,d)=>s+d,0);
      const approxMl = totalDrops*0.05; // mL
      const percent = Math.round((approxMl / Math.max(1,bottle)) * 100);
      // recommend safe ranges
      let note='Approx. '+percent+'%';
      if(percent<=1) note += ' (low)'; else if(percent<=3) note += ' (typical)'; else note += ' (use with caution)';
      return {title:'Topical dilution',note:note};
    }

    function generateInstructions(use,bottle,dilution){
      if(use==='inhalation'){
        return 'Add the drops to a diffuser or a tissue for occasional inhalation. Start with a small amount and observe how you respond.';
      }
      return 'Combine the recommended drops into a '+bottle+' mL carrier oil bottle. Shake gently before use. Apply a small patch test to the inner forearm and wait 24 hours for sensitivity. Use sparingly.';
    }

    function saveCard(){
      const el = document.getElementById('blendCard');
      const text = el.innerText || 'Blend saved.';
      // download as text file locally
      const blob = new Blob([text],'text/plain');
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a = document.createElement('a'); a.href=url;a.download='blend-card.txt';document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove();URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    }

    // Modal guided practice
    function openModal(id){
      document.getElementById('modalOverlay').classList.add('show');
      document.getElementById('modalOverlay').setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
      selectPractice('breath');
    }
    function closeModal(){
      document.getElementById('modalOverlay').classList.remove('show');
      document.getElementById('modalOverlay').setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
      // stop any running timers
      clearInterval(window._practiceInterval);
    }

    function selectPractice(key){
      const area=document.getElementById('practiceArea'); area.innerHTML=''; clearInterval(window._practiceInterval);
      if(key==='breath'){
        area.innerHTML = '<div class="timer" id="breathTimer">Ready</div><div class="muted" style="text-align:center;margin-top:8px">Follow the circle: inhale 4, hold 4, exhale 6. Repeat for 3 cycles.</div><div class="controls"><button onclick="startBreath()">Start</button><button onclick="stopBreath()">Stop</button></div><div id="breathCircle" style="width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#9fb49c);margin:12px auto"></div>';
      } else if(key==='journaling'){
        area.innerHTML = '<div class="muted">A short timed journaling prompt. Write untidily for 3 minutes. Prompts rotate.</div><div style="margin-top:8px"><textarea id="journal" rows="6" style="width:100%"></textarea></div><div class="controls"><button onclick="startJournal()">Start 3 min</button><button onclick="stopPractice()">Clear</button></div><div id="journalTimer" class="muted" style="text-align:center;margin-top:8px"></div>';
      } else if(key==='intention'){
        area.innerHTML = '<div class="muted">Set an intention in three short steps: name it, choose one tiny action, and note when you will do it.</div><ol style="margin-top:8px"><li><input placeholder="My intention..." style="width:100%"></li><li><input placeholder="One small action..." style="width:100%"></li><li><input placeholder="When will I do it?" style="width:100%"></li></ol><div class="controls"><button onclick="saveIntention()">Save</button></div><div id="intentionSaved" class="muted" style="text-align:center;margin-top:8px"></div>';
      }
    }

    // Breathing practice simple animation
    function startBreath(){
      const circle = document.getElementById('breathCircle'); const timer = document.getElementById('breathTimer');
      let phase = 0; // 0 inhale,1 hold,2 exhale
      let step = 0;
      const sequence = [4,4,6];
      function animatePhase(){
        const duration = sequence[phase]*1000;
        timer.textContent = (sequence[phase])+'s '+(phase===0?'inhale':phase===1?'hold':'exhale');
        circle.animate([{transform:'scale('+(phase===2?0.8:1)+')'},{transform:'scale('+(phase===2?1:1.1)+')'}],{duration:duration,iterations:1,easing:'ease-in-out'});
        phase = (phase+1)%3;
      }
      animatePhase();
      window._practiceInterval = setInterval(animatePhase, (sequence[0]+sequence[1]+sequence[2])*1000);
    }
    function stopBreath(){ clearInterval(window._practiceInterval); document.getElementById('breathTimer').textContent='Stopped'; }

    // Journaling timer
    function startJournal(){
      const timerEl = document.getElementById('journalTimer'); let t=3*60; timerEl.textContent = formatTime(t);
      window._practiceInterval = setInterval(()=>{ t--; timerEl.textContent=formatTime(t); if(t<=0){clearInterval(window._practiceInterval);timerEl.textContent='Complete — take a breath.';} },1000);
    }
    function stopPractice(){ clearInterval(window._practiceInterval); const jt=document.getElementById('journalTimer'); if(jt) jt.textContent='Cleared'; document.getElementById('journal').value=''; }
    function formatTime(s){ const m=Math.floor(s/60); const sec=s%60; return m+':'+(sec<10?'0':'')+sec; }
    function saveIntention(){ document.getElementById('intentionSaved').textContent='Saved locally for now.'; }

    // Utils
    // initialize blend
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{ buildBlend(); });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact & Tools — Aromatherapy Template (chunk 4)

This chunk contains two files for the aromatherapy website build: contact.html and README.md.

Purpose
- contact.html: a stand-alone contact page that includes:
  - A contact form that opens a mailto: to the configured {{EMAIL}} (no backend).
  - Blend builder: choose a mood/vibe and get a non-medical suggested blend, with a safety-first dilution guide, patch-test reminders, and pet/pregnancy notes.
  - A guided micro-practice modal implemented in pure JS (three short practices: breathing, journaling, intention-setting).
  - FAQ items about dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy exposure.
- README.md: this file, documenting what is included and how to test it locally.

Placeholders
- The HTML uses the following placeholders which should be replaced by your templating or deployment process:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}} (not placed on this page but present site-wide)
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

Features implemented (local-only)
- Blend builder
  - Select a vibe, pick inhalation or topical, choose bottle size.
  - Generates a suggested list of drops scaled to bottle size.
  - Computes a simple dilution note for topical use and gives safe-language instructions.
  - Save function downloads a simple text 'blend card' locally.
  - All content is non-medical and uses "may support" style language in copy.

- Guided micro-practice modal
  - Breathing: a 3-phase breathe/hold/exhale animated routine with timer.
  - Journaling: a 3-minute timed prompt with a text area.
  - Intention: three quick fields to record a small intention; saved locally in the modal.
  - Implemented using vanilla JS and DOM APIs; no external libraries.

Safety & Compliance
- The page intentionally avoids medical claims and includes clear safety notes: patch testing, pet guidance, pregnancy advisories.
- The FAQ explicitly calls out dilution guidance and encourages consultation of a qualified provider for pregnancy or medical questions.

Assets
- The page references a local SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for visual texture. Ensure that file exists in your project. No external fonts, images, or CDNs are used.

Local testing
1. Place this file alongside the other site pages in a static site folder.
2. Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists (unique pattern required elsewhere in the project).
3. Open contact.html in a browser. The form triggers a mailto: to {{EMAIL}}.
4. Use the Blend builder and the Guided Practice modal to test functionality.

Notes for integration
- Replace placeholders with your templating engine or during build time.
- This is chunk 4 of the larger site — other pages (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html) are required for full navigation coherence.

Accessibility
- Modal uses aria-modal and role=dialog.
- Buttons and form controls are keyboard accessible.

If you need this page adapted into your component system or refactored to integrate a backend contact endpoint, I can update the form behavior and data handling."}
